uilt only from Adapter Widgets (Panel dialog, Stack, Text, Icon, TextInput, Checkbox, Button); no Widget outside the Adapter catalog.","The three dialogs are three Panels (a Panel title is fixed); the Evidence lines, the key errors and the stages are shown by Variants; the acknowledgement sentence is a baked sample because a Checkbox interpolates no parameter; the impact list is sample data of two effects.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except the keys, the thread and Evidence identifiers and the View name; en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["A holder of settings.write on a desktop layout chose Rename key or Remove from the row menu of a saved viewport or theme, or pressed Save changes on a section whose change removes or renames a key.","The base state is Rename key for the viewport tablet: the new key typed as the old one, the Evidence check finished with no Evidence captured with it, and the acknowledgement not given.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the dialog is centered over a dimmed ground."],"intent":"Show the confirmations of the Workspace settings page as built from Adapter Widgets only: renaming or removing a saved viewport or theme key after reading what refers to it, and saving anyway after the server lists the impact of a settings change.","interactionRules":["Rename asks for a new key (without spaces, different from the old one, used by no other row) and Remove none; both name what refers to the key: the Evidence captured with it (checking, unknown, none, or the count that will read as stale) and the links that name it.","The change reaches the draft only after the person ticks that references to the key will not follow it; Rename stays disabled until then and until the new key is valid.","Saving a section that removes or renames a key writes nothing on the first request: the 